        "@id": "https://www.theflavorbender.com/#/schema/person/ab6f60ebb738d3347a2b3dfb5ad2b43c"
      },
      "description": "Sweet, salty, rich, and with plenty of umami flavor - these jammy Ramen Eggs (Ajitsuke Tamago) are simple, versatile and perfect in your ramen bowl, or any other way you eat them! Minimum marinating time of 2 hours, or up to 12 hours (optimal). EASY - This recipe is great for beginners. Easy to make and packed with flavor!US based cup, teaspoon, tablespoon measurements. Common Measurement Conversions",
      "datePublished": "2019-01-09T21:11:05+00:00",
      "image": [
